## Getting Started

### 1. Install the Framework
```bash
npm install @obinexus/u-framework
```

### 2. Initialize Your Project
```bash
obix init my-ethical-app
cd my-ethical-app
```

### 3. Create Your First Interface
```typescript
import { Interface, DignityProvider } from '@obinexus/u-framework';

export default function App() {
  return (
    <DignityProvider constitution="enforced">
      <Interface
        respects="user-agency"
        celebrates="neurodiversity"
        protects="privacy"
      >
        {/* Your dignified UI here */}
      </Interface>
    </DignityProvider>
  );
}
```

### 4. Test for Human Rights
```bash
# Run constitutional tests
obix test --constitutional

# Validate accessibility
obix test --accessibility

# Check neurodiversity support
obix test --cognitive-patterns
```

